program	errors/align_above_cap.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	`@align` on the local `body` is `8192`, above the largest alignment Saw will request (`4096`)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: `@align` on the local `body` is `8192`, above the largest alignment Saw will request (`4096`)"
log	"  --> examples/errors/align_above_cap.saw:7:12"
log	"    |"
log	" 7 |     @align(8192)"
log	"    |            ^"
log	"   hint: `4096` is one page on every target Saw builds for; a stack slot or an ordinary global cannot honour more"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
